    "result": {"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Industry Context:</strong> Built for Cement and Heavy Manufacturing industries dealing with raw material grinding and bulk particle processing.</li>\n<li><strong>Core Operation:</strong> Programmed strict sequential control to ensure machines (conveyors, chippers, and mills) start and stop in the exact required order to avoid material clogging.</li>\n<li><strong>Sensor &#x26; Monitoring:</strong> Integrated proximity and flow sensors for real-time process monitoring. Added load monitoring systems to detect motor stress.</li>\n<li><strong>Execution:</strong> Completed full control panel wiring, focusing on industrial standard cable routing and component layout.</li>\n<li><strong>Associated With:</strong> Ulterior Engineering Ltd.</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Particle Mill Process & Chipper Machine Control","date":"2026-07-04","tech":["Sequential Control","Sensor Integration","Load Monitoring","Panel Wiring"],"github":"","external":"","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/4d5c4/particle-mill.jpg","srcSet":"/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/67e32/particle-mill.jpg 160w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/fc269/particle-mill.jpg 320w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/4d5c4/particle-mill.jpg 640w","sizes":"(min-width: 640px) 640px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/171aa/particle-mill.avif 160w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/27af9/particle-mill.avif 320w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/80a20/particle-mill.avif 640w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 640px) 640px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/79906/particle-mill.webp 160w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455abe50d6669/8c64a/particle-mill.webp 320w,\n/static/0231b33d9b5c07f1824455ab